{"step_index":2250,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:33:26Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Complete walkthrough of World-Class Enhancements and Hybrid Calendar Suite implemented and deployed live to Surge.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: World-Class ValuTeachers Dialer & Calendar Suite\n\n## 1. Features Implemented\n\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                   WORLD-CLASS ENHANCEMENTS DELIVERED                     │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 1. 📅 Hybrid Calendar Piping Engine (Apple .ics / Google / Outlook)     │\n│ 2. 🏫 Campus Clustered Geodialing (Filter & Batch Dial by School)        │\n│ 3. 🛡️ Live Objection Battlecards Overlay (Word-for-Word FRS Scripts)     │\n│ 4. 📊 Planning Period Visual Heatmap (Weekly Sit-Down Availability Grid)│\n│ 5. 📑 Two-Way CSV / Excel Pipeline Sync (Export Pipeline & Import Roster)│\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Component Details\n\n### A. Hybrid Calendar Piping Engine ([`src/services/calendarService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/calendarService.ts))\n- **RFC 5545 Standard `.ics` Generator:** Generates native calendar invites for Apple Calendar (iPhone/iPad/Mac) and Outlook.\n- **Direct Web Links:** One-tap triggers for Google Calendar and Outlook/Office 365.\n- **Pre-Configured Alarms:** Injects a **15-minute pre-bell alert** with educator room numbers and handwritten card questions.\n- **Integrated Touchpoints:** Accessible directly inside the `🎯 Appt. Set` modal in the Dialer HUD and the educator's profile page.\n\n### B. Campus Clustered Geodialing ([`src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx))\n- **Campus Quick-Filter Strip:** Displays active school chips (e.g. `🏫 DeLand High (4)`, `🏫 Pine Ridge (3)`).\n- **Batch Power Dialing:** Tapping \"Start Power Dialing Queue\" while a campus is selected batches only educators on that campus back-to-back.\n\n### C. Live Objection Battlecards Overlay ([`src/data/objections.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/data/objections.ts), [`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx))\n- **Cockpit Header Pill (`🛡️ Scripts`):** One-tap popover accessible during live calls without losing call timer or notes.\n- **6 Florida Educator Battlecard Categories:**\n  - *“I already have an advisor / someone for that”* (FRS state pension differentiation)\n  - *“I’m way too busy / no time right now”* (10-minute classroom pop-in)\n  - *“Only in years 1–5, don't need retirement yet”* (Vesting cliff & 5% bonus)\n  - *“What is DROP?”* (Deferred Retirement Option Program lump sum)\n  - *“Are you with the school district or union?”* (Approved payroll educational specialist)\n  - *“Can you just email me the info?”* (Unique pension formula explanation)\n\n### D. Planning Period Visual Heatmap ([`src/screens/PlanningHeatmapScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/PlanningHeatmapScreen.tsx))\n- Visual Mon–Fri grid broken down by Florida bell schedules (Periods 1–7 and After School).\n- Highlights confirmed sit-downs vs pending contacts.\n- Accessible directly via the Calendar icon in the main header.\n\n### E. Two-Way CSV / Excel Pipeline Sync ([`src/services/csvService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/csvService.ts), [`src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx))\n- **1-Click Pipeline Export:** Exports all contacts, dispositions, timestamps, and notes directly to Excel UTF-8 CSV.\n- **Bulk Roster Import:** Imports school staff lists with intelligent column mapping (`Name`, `Phone`, `School`, `Room`, `Planning`).\n\n---\n\n## 3. Live Production Deployment\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**\n","Description":"Update walkthrough with complete documentation of World-Class Enhancements","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing walkthrough.md","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md"}}]}
