{"step_index":2252,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:33:31Z","content":"### 🚀 World-Class Enhancements & Hybrid Calendar Suite Deployed!\n\nAll recommendations from the **World-Class Roadmap** and the **Hybrid Calendar Integration Suite** have been implemented and deployed live.\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 What Has Been Built & Added\n\n```\n   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   │                   SNAPDIALER WORLD-CLASS SUITE               │\n   └──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘\n                                  │\n      ┌───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┐\n      ▼                           ▼                           ▼\n[HYBRID CALENDAR PIPING]    [CAMPUS GEODIALING]      [LIVE OBJECTION HUD]\n• 1-Tap Apple Cal (.ics)    • School Proximity Chips • 1-Tap Cockpit Drawer\n• 1-Tap Google Cal Link     • Single Campus Batching • Word-for-Word Scripts\n• 1-Tap Outlook Web Link    • Zero-Drive Scheduling  • Psychology Insights\n• 15-Min Pre-Bell Alarms    • Campus-Only Queues     • 6 Educator Categories\n      │                           │                           │\n      └───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┘\n                                  │\n                                  ▼\n                [PLANNING HEATMAP & TWO-WAY CSV SYNC]\n                • Mon–Fri Bell Schedule Visual Grid (Periods 1–7)\n                • 1-Click Excel / Google Sheets Pipeline Export\n                • Bulk School Staff Roster CSV Import & Column Mapper\n```\n\n---\n\n### 1. 📅 Hybrid Calendar Piping Engine ([`calendarService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/calendarService.ts))\n- **1-Tap Apple Calendar (`.ics`):** Tapping **🍏 Apple / iCal** downloads/opens native Apple Calendar on iPhone, iPad, or Mac with title, classroom room number, and FRS notes pre-filled.\n- **1-Tap Google & Outlook Web:** Opens direct pre-populated composer tabs on web/Android.\n- **Automated 15-Minute Pre-Bell Alert:** Injects a notification reminder `15 minutes` before the start time so the representative has time to walk across campus to the classroom.\n- **Integrated Touchpoints:** Embedded inside the `🎯 Appt. Set` modal in the Dialer Cockpit and on the Educator Detail page.\n\n---\n\n### 2. 🏫 Campus Clustered Geodialing ([`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx), [`leadsRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/leadsRepository.ts))\n- **Campus Quick-Filter Chips:** Displays active school campuses (e.g. `🏫 DeLand High (4)`, `🏫 Pine Ridge (3)`).\n- **Single-Campus Batch Queue:** Selecting a school chip and tapping *\"Start Power Dialing Queue\"* batches only educators from that campus back-to-back, allowing representatives to book 4–5 classroom sit-downs at the same school on the same afternoon.\n\n---\n\n### 3. 🛡️ Live Objection Battlecards Overlay ([`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx), [`objections.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/data/objections.ts))\n- **Cockpit Header Pill (`🛡️ Scripts`):** One-tap slide-up drawer accessible during live calls without pausing the call timer.\n- **Word-for-Word Florida Educator Scripts:**\n  1. *“I already have an advisor”* ➔ Differentiate yourself as the state-mandated FRS pension calculation and DROP specialist.\n  2. *“I’m way too busy / no time”* ➔ 10-minute classroom pop-in during their exact planning period.\n  3. *“I’m only in years 1–5”* ➔ Explain the 8-year vesting cliff and early 5% compound bonus advantages.\n  4. *“What is DROP?”* ➔ Explain Deferred Retirement Option Program lump-sum payouts.\n  5. *“Are you with the district or union?”* ➔ Clarify approved payroll vendor and independent educational partner.\n  6. *“Can you just email me the info?”* ➔ Explain why unique pension formulas require a personalized 10-minute breakdown.\n\n---\n\n### 4. 📊 Planning Period Visual Heatmap ([`PlanningHeatmapScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/PlanningHeatmapScreen.tsx))\n- **Visual Bell Schedule Grid:** Breaks down Monday–Friday availability across Periods 1 through 7 and After School.\n- **Double-Booking Guard:** Instantly see where confirmed sit-downs land against open planning slots.\n- **Quick Access:** Tapping the `📅` icon in the main header opens the full planning grid.\n\n---\n\n### 5. 📑 Two-Way CSV / Excel Pipeline Sync ([`csvService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/csvService.ts), [`SettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx))\n- **1-Click Pipeline Export:** Tapping `📥` or using Global Settings exports all educator records, call history, timestamps, and notes to Microsoft Excel / Google Sheets CSV.\n- **Bulk School Staff Roster Import:** Paste CSV text from district spreadsheets; SnapDialer automatically maps `Name`, `Phone`, `School`, `Room`, and `Planning Period`.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Live Production Deployment\nThe full suite is live and active:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
